	(text "Continuity sense, opto-isolated. SENSE ONLY - the\nIGNIS gate drive is NOT reused (D-045).\nNOT FUNCTIONAL AS DRAWN: R_CONT + LED sit in\nPARALLEL with the match and nothing sources them\nbefore arming, so the lamp can never light. It fails\nto the 'no match' reading, which is the safe direction.\nNeeds a pre-arm TEST source - decision D-B, review owner.\nR_CONT must also survive the POST-FIRE case: once the\nmatch opens while FIRE is held, the full rail sits across\nR_CONT + LED to PYRO_RTN. Size it for continuous 12 V,\nnot only for the sense condition."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 176.6400 455.4000 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.35 1.35)
				(thickness 0.20)
				(bold no)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b1e8f197-3afa-4768-a2e6-0cebd4d6bb9b")
	)
